### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api

### 1. Root Health Check
GET http://localhost:5001/

### 2. GET All Equipment Fleet
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipment

### 3. GET Equipment with Filters (Search & Category)
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipment?category=Power Tools&search=drill

### 4. GET Equipment Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipment/categories

### 5. GET Single Equipment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipment/1

### 6. GET Single Equipment - 404 Test
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipment/999

### 7. POST Create New Equipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CAT 301.5 Mini Excavator",
  "category": "Heavy Machinery",
  "dailyRate": 3500,
  "description": "Compact mini hydraulic excavator for earthmoving and landscaping projects.",
  "serialNumber": "CAT-MINI-091",
  "location": "Yard North 2",
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572981779307-38b8cabb2407?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
}

### 8. PUT Update Equipment Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/equipment/3/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Available"
}

### 9. DELETE Equipment by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/equipment/6

### 10. GET All Active & Past Rentals
GET {{baseUrl}}/rentals

### 11. POST Create New Rental Booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/rentals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipmentId": 1,
  "customerName": "Sreejesh Mohan",
  "customerEmail": "sreejesh@example.com",
  "customerPhone": "9876543210",
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "rentalDays": 3
}

### 12. PUT Mark Rental as Returned
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rentals/101/return
